COPY public.faqs (id, question, answer, "order", "isActive", "categoryId", "createdAt", "updatedAt") FROM stdin;
3e8d875f-6f05-4c05-bef5-124489fa3a91	Is Pin N Post free to use?	Yes, basic features are free to use. We only charge a small fee for premium features like promoting your ads.	2	t	8155e731-70a5-4437-95d8-2d22b17cb422	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036
f3c7f3b3-2130-4695-8a41-c5b34e331546	How do I buy an item?	Simply browse through listings, contact seller through our messaging system, and arrange for pickup or delivery. Always verify the item before making payment.	1	t	6e553a89-e4d4-48d8-b4b6-28d9f9cf1416	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036
335f1c21-66e0-4bc2-86cc-a7bcb243ba24	Is it safe to buy from unknown sellers?	We recommend meeting in public places and inspecting items before payment. Never share financial information outside our platform.	2	t	6e553a89-e4d4-48d8-b4b6-28d9f9cf1416	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036
4008ee74-bb14-48f8-869a-677a170ccabc	How do I list an item for sale?	Click on "Post Ad", choose your category, upload photos, write a description, set your price, and publish. Your ad will be live immediately!	1	t	0e043a68-baae-4d6d-b16e-eab6cca66e07	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036
bf2de79e-d8fb-4e84-bd78-7fb6095a763d	How much does it cost to post an ad?	Basic ads are free for 7 days. You can extend or promote your ads for a small fee to get more visibility.	2	t	0e043a68-baae-4d6d-b16e-eab6cca66e07	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036
2fa37ad9-d4a5-47b5-871f-0417a9b50817	How do I create an account?	Download our app or visit our website, click on "Sign Up", enter your phone number, verify it with OTP, and you're ready to go!	1	t	157c6807-4ea4-47aa-a0a4-49ff4ecfa5fb	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036
36cfd814-2f39-4aa4-bd8f-3838a5c6d9ea	How can I report suspicious activity?	Use the "Report" button on any listing or user profile. Our team reviews all reports and takes appropriate action.	2	t	157c6807-4ea4-47aa-a0a4-49ff4ecfa5fb	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036
c0a6928a-5cf7-4ca2-a563-489ebc3e21bf	What is PinNPost?	<p>Pin N Post is a local marketplace platform that connects buyers and sellers in their community. You can buy and sell various items safely and easily.</p>	1	t	8155e731-70a5-4437-95d8-2d22b17cb422	2026-02-19 06:12:32.036	2026-02-23 05:20:13.179
