COPY public.legal_documents (id, title, slug, content, "isActive", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt") FROM stdin;
6fb2789e-3711-4c1f-a7cf-7b055a9ddbd2	Account Deletion Policy	account-deletion	<h1>Account Deletion Policy</h1><p>Last updated: December 31, 2025</p><h2>Your Right to Delete</h2><p>You have the right to delete your Pin N Post account at any time. When you delete your account, the following will occur:</p><h2>What Gets Deleted</h2><ul><li>Your profile information (name, email, phone number)</li><li>Your account credentials</li><li>Your notification preferences</li><li>Your saved locations</li><li>Your wishlist items</li></ul><h2>What Happens to Your Content</h2><ul><li><strong>Active Ads:</strong> All your active ads will be permanently removed from the platform</li><li><strong>Bookings:</strong> Pending bookings will be cancelled. Completed booking records may be retained for legal and accounting purposes</li><li><strong>Transactions:</strong> Transaction records will be retained as required by law for tax and financial reporting</li><li><strong>Messages:</strong> Your messages with other users will be anonymized</li></ul><h2>Data Retention</h2><p>Some data may be retained for:</p><ul><li>Legal compliance (tax records, transaction history)</li><li>Fraud prevention and security</li><li>Backup systems (automatically purged within 90 days)</li></ul><h2>How to Delete Your Account</h2><ol><li>Log in to your account</li><li>Go to Settings</li><li>Select Delete Account</li><li>Confirm your decision</li></ol><p><strong>Note:</strong> Account deletion is permanent and cannot be undone. You will need to create a new account if you wish to use our services again.</p><h2>Contact Us</h2><p>If you have questions about account deletion, contact us at: support@pinnpost.com</p>	t	2026-02-19 06:12:32.441	2026-02-19 06:12:32.441	2026-02-19 06:12:32.441
df88a973-6209-4f5f-8822-08f3b3ccc0c3	Terms of Service	terms-of-service	<h1>TERMS AND CONDITIONS</h1><p><em>These Terms of Use were updated on 1st February 2026</em></p><p>Please carefully read these Terms of Use. By using this platform, you indicate your understanding and acceptance of these terms.</p><p>In the event of non-compliance with these Terms of Use, Pin N Post (PNP) has the right to limit or terminate your access or usage rights to the platform immediately or remove non-compliant information or both as the case may be, in accordance with the Information Technology (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Rules, 2021, and amendments thereof. By using the PNP platform and accessing our services, you indicate your understanding and agreement to be bound by the terms stated under Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree to these Terms of Use, you may not use the platform and the services.</p><h2>Acceptance</h2><ul><li><p>Pin N Post is a company that is incorporated in India under the Companies Act, 2013, having its registered office at Sahakarnagar off Airport Road, Bangalore 560092.</p></li><li><p>Pin N Post is licensee and operator of the Platform, which provides:</p><ul><li><p>A collection of online resources which includes classified advertisements, listings and related support on the listings through the select entities on the website <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.pinnpost.com">www.pinnpost.com</a> ("Service"), and the corresponding mobile application of the platform;</p></li><li><p>An online service for selling cars by connecting the seller with select partners on websites, and the corresponding mobile applications of the platforms (collectively, the "Platform").</p></li></ul></li><li><p>The Platform and the Service are provided to you subject to these PNP Terms of Use (these "Terms"). For the purpose of the Terms and wherever the context so requires, the terms "you" and "your" shall mean any person who uses or accesses, whether through manual or automated means, the Platform or the Service in any manner whatsoever including persons browsing the Platform and its content, sharing information regarding their listings and/or advertising of the products and services including but not limited to electronics and appliances, commercial vehicles and spares, books and hobbies, property, jobs, cattle feed, tools on the platform ("Listed Items") to obtain a price estimate, posting comments or any content or responding to any advertisements or content on the Platform, as applicable. By using the Service, you agree to comply with these Terms. Additionally, when using a portion of the Service, you agree to conform to any and all applicable posted guidelines for such Service, which may change or be updated from time to time at PNP's sole discretion. You understand and agree that you are solely responsible for reviewing these Terms from time to time. Should you object to any term or condition of these Terms, any guideline, or any subsequent changes thereto or become unhappy with PNP or the Service in any way, your only choice is to immediately discontinue the use of PNP. These Terms may be updated by PNP at any time at its sole discretion. PNP may send you notices of changes to the Platform or the Terms pursuant to Section "I" herein.</p></li><li><p>PNP may provide a translation of the English version of the Terms into other languages. You understand and agree that any translation of the Terms into other languages is for your convenience only and that the English version governs the terms of your relationship with PNP. Furthermore, if there are any inconsistencies between the English version of the Terms and any translation, the English version of the Terms shall prevail.</p></li></ul><h2>Description of Service and Content Policy</h2><ul><li><p>PNP operates the next generation of online platforms. We act merely as an intermediary to allow our users who comply with these Terms to offer, sell, and buy Listed Items. Although you may be able to conduct payment and other transactions through the Platform using third-party vendors, PNP is not in any way involved in such transactions. As a result, and as discussed in more detail in these Terms, you hereby acknowledge and agree that PNP is not a party to such transactions, has no control over any element of such transactions, and shall have no liability to any party in connection with such transactions. You use the Service and the Platform at your own risk.</p></li><li><p>PNP partners with select partners/entities to offer additional services in respect of your sale or purchase of Listed Items. Such select partners may offer additional services to enable you to sell or buy your listed items and to avail additional facilities associated to the buying and selling of your listed items in a hassle-free manner. You acknowledge that PNP undertakes such partnerships solely to enhance your experience on the Platform and provide speedy solutions. Once you choose to accept the services of such a select partner, you acknowledge that you transition outside the scope of the Platform and the Services, and PNP does not exercise any control in any form and manner of the terms of provision of such services by select partners/entities. In such cases, you shall evaluate the terms and conditions of such other partner/entity. PNP shall not be responsible for any service(s) availed by you from such third parties or any payment made by you to such third parties in connection with the services. Any concern or claims in relation to such services should be directed by you to such third parties. You may opt-out of such additional services in accordance with our Privacy Policy and the policies of such third parties with proper due diligence and care at your own sole risk and expenses.</p></li><li><p>PNP provides a marketplace for listings which enables users ("Listers") to publish, advertise and list the Listed Items on PNP's platform. PNP does not own or manage the listings and is not a party to any interactions and contracts between Listers and potential buyers. Further, any kind of listings on the platform, PNP clarifies that it is not a developer, broker or agent and is not acting as an agent in any capacity for any user, advertiser, Lister and/or buyer etc. If you are entering this platform in any capacity, you acknowledge that PNP exercises no control over listings, including but not limited to any information provided therein. PNP however, reserves the sole right to monitor and moderate content at its own discretion for platform operation, fraud prevention, compliance, and quality assurance and reserve right to take any suitable action to ensure the same. If you are a Lister or an advertiser you further acknowledge that PNP has the right, but does not have any obligation, to monitor the use of your listing and verify information provided by you. By posting a listing on the Platform you acknowledge and agree that PNP may share your contact details including your phone number with select users subscribed to PNP's premium features and programs to enable buyer seller communication even if you have not opted to make this information publicly visible on your listing.</p></li><li><p>You understand that PNP does not control, and is not responsible for ads, directory information, business listings/information, messages between users, communications with the select partners, including without limitation e-mails sent from outside PNP's domain or other means of electronic communication, whether through the Platform or another Third Party Website (defined below) or offerings, comments, user postings, files, images, photos, video, sounds, business listings/information and directory information or any other material made available through the Platform and the Service ("Content"), and that by using the Platform and the Service, you may be exposed to Content that is offensive, indecent, inaccurate, misleading, or otherwise objectionable. You acknowledge and agree that you are responsible for and must evaluate, and bear all risks associated with your listing including but not limited to the claims, infringement, damages, suits, loss(es), fine, penalties or any other actions against this by any local or statutory authorities, that you may not rely on said Content, and that under no circumstances will PNP be liable in any way for the Content or for any claims, infringement, damages, suits, loss(es), fine, penalties or any other actions against this by any local or statutory authorities of any kind incurred as a result of the browsing, using or reading any Content listed, emailed or otherwise made available via the Service. You acknowledge and agree that PNP cannot and does not pre-screen or approve any Content, but that PNP has the right, in its sole and absolute discretion, to refuse, delete or move any Content that is or may be available through the Service, for violating these Terms and such violation being brought to PNP's knowledge or for any other reason or no reason at all. Furthermore, the Platform and Content available through the Platform may contain links to other third-party websites ("Third Party Websites"), which are related or unrelated to PNP. If you are directed to such Third Party Websites, you may be subject to those Third Party Websites' terms and conditions and their policies. PNP makes no representation or guarantee as to the accuracy or authenticity of the information contained in any such Third Party Website, and your usage to any other websites is completely at your own risk and PNP being an intermediary disclaims all liability thereto.</p></li><li><p>You being a Lister and/or advertiser acknowledge and agree that you are solely responsible for your own Content posted on, transmitted through, or linked from the Service and the consequences of posting, transmitting, linking, or publishing it. More specifically, you are solely responsible for all Content that you upload, email, or otherwise make available via the Service. In connection with such Content posted on, transmitted through, or linked from the Service by you, you affirm, acknowledge, represent, warrant and covenant that:</p><ul><li><p>You own or have and shall continue to, for such time the Content is available on the Platform, subject clause III mentioned below you have the necessary and valid licenses, approvals, rights, consents, and permissions to use such Content on the Service and Platform (including without limitation all patent, trademark, trade secret, copyright or other proprietary rights in and to any and all such Content) and authorize PNP to use such Content to enable inclusion and use of the Content in the manner contemplated by the Service, the Platform and these Terms; and</p></li><li><p>You have the written consent, release, and/or permission of each and every identifiable individual person or business in the Content to use the name or likeness of each and every such identifiable individual person or business to enable inclusion and use of the Content in the manner contemplated by the Service, the Platform and these Terms.</p></li></ul><p> For clarity, you retain all of your ownership rights in your Content; however, by submitting any Content on the Platform, you hereby grant to PNP an irrevocable, non-cancellable, perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, sub-licensable, transferable license to use, reproduce, distribute, prepare derivative works of, display, and perform the Content including your personal data in connection with the Platform and PNP's (and its successor's) business, including without limitation for the purpose of promoting and redistributing part or all of the Platform and Content therein (and derivative works thereof) in any media formats and through any media channels now or hereafter known. These rights are required by PNP in order to host and display your Content. Furthermore, by you posting Content to any public area of the Service, you agree to and do hereby grant to PNP all rights necessary to prohibit or allow any subsequent aggregation, display, copying, duplication, reproduction, or exploitation of the Content on the Service or Platform by any party for any purpose. As a part of the Service, PNP may offer the facility of automatically capturing the "Description" of your ad based on the images uploaded by you. PNP makes no warranty on the veracity or the accuracy of the generated Description. The Description may be edited by you at any time while your ad is live. You also hereby grant each user and PNP of the Platform (a) a non-exclusive license to access your Content through the Platform, and (b) the right to contact you with regard to the Content posted by you through private chat or any other means. The foregoing license to each user granted by you terminates once you or PNP remove or delete such Content from the Platform. Further, you grant PNP the right to make available your Content to any third party in connection with the transaction contemplated in your classified advertisement.</p></li><li><p>PNP does not endorse any Content or any opinion, statement, recommendation, or advice expressed therein, and PNP expressly disclaims any and all liability in connection with User Content. PNP does not permit copyright infringing activities and infringement of intellectual property rights on the Platform, and PNP may, at its sole discretion, remove any infringing Content if properly notified in accordance with applicable law that such Content infringes on another's intellectual property rights. PNP reserves the right to remove any Content without prior notice. PNP may also terminate a user's access to the Platform if they are determined to be a repeat infringer or found to be indulging in any act contrary to these Terms. A repeat infringer is a user who has been notified of infringing activity more than twice and/or has had a user submission removed from the Platform more than twice. Further, at its sole discretion, PNP reserves the right to decide whether any Content is appropriate and complies with these Terms.</p></li></ul><h2>General Guidelines for Listings and Advertisements</h2><h3>A. Submission Guidelines for Listings/Advertisements/Publishing</h3><ol><li><p>Lister agrees not to submit any descriptions, photographs, financial, contact or other information contained in any Listed Item and/or any advertisement of an already Listed Item and/or additional product, service, property on PNP's Platform (Advertisement) unless the Lister submitting such a Listed Item and/or Advertisement has acquired and received all necessary rights and authorizations from the owner of such Listed Item and/or Advertisement or the power-of-attorney holder, including from the photographer and/or copyright owner of any photographs, to sell, lease, rent, publish/list and advertise the said Listed Item and/or Advertisement on PNP's website and app. Similarly, PNP does not take any ownership, directly or indirectly towards any person whatsoever, with respect to banners hosted on its website by its customers, which are strictly in the nature of sale of advertisement space by PNP &amp; it has not carried out any independent verification on the authenticity of such images/banners/listings. Some listings may contain third party video content provided for general informational purposes only and such content does not constitute a recommendation or solicitation or intends to influence any type of purchase or decision. No guarantees are made by PNP or the providers of the video content as to its accuracy or completeness.</p></li><li><p>The PNP platform is only for the users who are above 18 years of age (major) and, we do not promote the platform to be used by any person below 18 years of age (minor). However, the Listers still agree not to engage in any advertising that condones, encourages, or emulates behavior that could be dangerous for children; takes advantage of children's inexperience, credulity, or sense of loyalty; exaggerates the features of goods or services to lead children to have unrealistic expectations; condones or encourages practices detrimental to children's physical health or mental well-being; implies that children are likely to be ridiculed or made to feel inferior if they do not purchase or use such goods or services; includes direct exhortations to children to purchase goods or services or persuade others to do so on their behalf; uses qualifiers such as 'just' or 'only' to make the price of goods or services seem less expensive when additional costs are included; features children in advertisements prohibited by law, including those for tobacco or alcohol-based products; features personalities from sports, music, or cinema for products that require a health warning or cannot be purchased by children; makes it difficult for children to judge the size, characteristics, and performance of advertised products or to distinguish between real-life situations and fantasy; exaggerates what is attainable by an ordinary child using the product; exploits children's susceptibility to charitable appeals without explaining the extent to which their participation will help in any charity-linked promotions; resorts to promotions requiring a purchase to participate and includes direct exhortations to make a purchase addressed to or targeted at children; claims that consumption of a product will enhance intelligence or physical ability without valid substantiation; claims health or nutritional benefits without adequate scientific evidence; or publishes advertisements in mass media, including network games, for medical services, drugs, dietary supplements, medical instruments, cosmetic products, liquor, or cosmetic surgery that are adverse to the physical and mental health of children. Additionally, such advertisements should not develop negative body image in children or give the impression that such goods or services are better than natural or traditional foods children may be consuming. Any advertisement offering promotional gifts to persuade children to buy goods or services without necessity or promoting illogical consumerism shall be discouraged.</p></li><li><p>Listers agree to comply with all applicable laws and shall ensure that their listings and advertisements on PNP platform comply with all applicable legal and regulatory requirements, including but not limited to those related to licensing, consumer protection and product safety. Listers agree not to engage in unfair trade practices and to provide clear and accessible information to consumers, including the name of their business (whether registered or not), geographic address, helpline number (when requested), any ratings or aggregated feedback, clear pictures of their products and/or services, and any other necessary details. Upon written request from PNP, the Listers will immediately supply information such as the principal geographic address of their headquarters and branches, website details, email address, and other information essential for effective dispute resolution and will further disclose information related to returns, refunds, exchanges, warranties, guarantees, delivery, shipment, modes of payment, grievance redressal mechanisms, and any other relevant details on an immediate basis. The available payment methods, their security, any applicable fees or charges, procedures to cancel regular payments, charge-back options, and contact information of the Listers will be provided to the consumers. Additionally, listers will provide an explanation of the main parameters that determine the ranking of goods on their Listing/Advertisement, including the relative importance of these parameters, in plain and intelligible language. Further, Listers must adhere to and shall be bound by all policies, rules, and guidelines published from time to time on the PNP Platform, including those available at <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.pinnpost.in">www.pinnpost.in</a> &gt; Help &gt; Help and Support, and are required to keep themselves updated on such policies and guidelines on a regular basis.</p></li><li><p>PNP may, at its sole discretion but without any obligation, search and remove such Listed Items posted on its website by the Listers that are alleged to have been submitted in violation of the above provision. In addition, PNP may require additional evidence of compliance with this provision from Listers who are alleged to have submitted listings in violation of these terms and conditions. PNP will, in its sole discretion, terminate the accounts of, and refuse Services to, any Lister who repeatedly or intentionally violates these terms and conditions. Additionally, the Lister agrees to allow the listing, or any part of it, to be searched, displayed, accessed, downloaded, copied, and otherwise referred to by other users of the PNP website. PNP shall have the sole authority to choose the manner in which any listing will be searchable, displayed, accessed, downloaded, copied, and otherwise used on PNP's website and app and it shall have the right to modify the listing in the exercise of its rights under these terms and conditions.</p></li></ol><h3>B. Guidelines for Potential Buyers and Listers</h3><ol><li><p>At PNP, we prioritize transparency and reliability in our listings. We advise Listers, users/potential buyers to conduct thorough checks and establish the authenticity of any product, property or service before proceeding with any transaction. Please adhere to the following guidelines:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Independent Verification:</strong> Users/Potential buyers should conduct comprehensive checks to verify the authenticity of the Listing Item including their suitability for buying or renting. This verification should be done at the user/potential buyer's own expense and in a manner deemed appropriate.</p></li><li><p><strong>PNP's Role:</strong> As an online marketplace and merely being an intermediary PNP does not validate the authenticity of content provided in its services. Users/potential buyers should be aware that content is uploaded by Lister and Advertisers, and PNP does not filter or verify the same. However, we take prompt remedial measures upon receiving complaints.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ownership Verification:</strong> Users/Potential buyers are advised to conduct a comprehensive check of ownership to verify owners' or landlords' credentials.</p></li><li><p><strong>Personal Inspection:</strong> It is strongly recommended that users/potential buyers personally visit project sites or Listing Items to ensure the authenticity and existence of the Listed Item and/or Advertisement.</p></li><li><p><strong>Beware of False Documents:</strong> As and when applicable the Users/Potential buyers should exercise caution and conduct diligence regarding the required and valid documentation from the Lister and/or Advertiser.</p></li><li><p><strong>Compliance with Regulations:</strong> As and when applicable the Users/Potential buyers should independently ensure whether the Lister and/or Advertiser or the original Seller/Developer is complying with the provisions of all applicable laws.</p></li><li><p>Please note that PNP serves as an intermediary platform and does not facilitate, negotiate, or assist in sales between Lister and/or Advertiser and potential buyers. While we rely on the information provided by Listers for displaying Listing Items on our platform, users/potential buyers are strongly encouraged to validate all information and review terms and conditions before making any decisions.</p></li></ol></li></ol><p>A category-wise non-exhaustive list of mandatory guidelines and checks before buying or listing the Listed Items and/or Advertised Items is mentioned below:</p><p>Cars and Bikes</p><p>Prior to purchasing a car and/or bike listed on our platform, buyers are advised to check if the Lister/seller has complied with all relevant provisions of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 including but not limited to Form 29, state NoC, if applicable. Buyers are advised to carry out a thorough inspection of the vehicle's documentation, including registration papers, insurance, and pollution under control (PUC) certificate. Additionally, buyers should verify the vehicle's compliance with emission norms, as per the Central Motor Vehicles Rules, 1989, and conduct a detailed physical examination of the car and/or bike's condition. Additionally, buyers should verify the vehicle's roadworthiness and safety features in accordance with the standards outlined by the Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS). The Lister/Seller is legally liable to get RC transferred on the name of end buyer and be present for the Part Peshi at respective RTO physically. PNP being an intermediary is not liable to get the RC Transfer, be present for Party Peshi and resolve disputes between Lister and Potential Buyer in any form manner.</p><p>Properties</p><p>Prospective buyers of properties listed on our platform should conduct due diligence in accordance with the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 (RERA), by verifying all relevant legal documents including but not limited to ownership deeds, land titles, building approvals, and clearances from local authorities including but not limited to valid building sanctioned plan, completion certificate, occupation certificate, structural stability certificate, no encumbrance certificates, Fire NoC and other required documents as per applicable laws including but not limited to zoning regulations under the respective state's town planning laws and ensure adherence to the guidelines specified by the National Building Code of India, 2016 and building bye laws of each state. Additionally, the Lister(s) hereby agrees to obtain and ensure renewals of all aforesaid permissions, approvals, certifications with respect to the project/land/apartment/plot/building/house listed or advertised on PNP platform. The Lister in addition shall furnish a brief background of such property in respect of title, ownership and possession, PNP may also require the Lister to support its claims with respect to the status of the property with such documents as may be specified by PNP from time to time. The Lister shall, as and when required, shall further substantiate its claims as to the nature and status of the property by swearing an affidavit stating the authenticity of the information/data so provided/displayed.</p><p>Mobiles</p><p>Buyers considering the purchase of a mobile phone from our platform should thoroughly and physically inspect the device's specifications, condition, and functionality. It is also recommended that buyers verify the authenticity of the mobile phone's IMEI number as per the guidelines issued by the Department of Telecommunications (DoT). The Lister should support the potential buyers in such diligence.</p><p>Jobs</p><p>Job seekers engaging with listings on our platform should exercise caution by verifying the authenticity of job offers, including the employer's registration status and compliance with Indian labour laws. Additionally, job seekers should ensure transparency in recruitment processes and seek clarification on any discrepancies or ambiguities in the job listing before proceeding with applications or interviews. The Lister should support the potential buyers in such diligence by producing such documents to the potential buyer/user of the Platform.</p><p>Electronics and Appliances</p><p>Prior to purchasing electronic devices or appliances listed on our platform, buyers are advised to inspect the product's specifications, condition, and warranty terms. Buyers are recommended to ensure the product's adherence to the safety and quality standards prescribed by the Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS) and verify the authenticity of the product's certification marks as per the guidelines issued by the Ministry of Consumer Affairs. The Lister should support the potential buyers in such diligence.</p><p>Commercial Vehicles &amp; Spares</p><p>Prospective buyers of commercial vehicles or spare parts listed on our platform should ensure adherence to the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988, and verify the authenticity of the vehicle's registration documents, fitness certificate, and permit as mandated by the Central Motor Vehicles Rules, 1989. Additionally, buyers should ensure compliance with the safety and performance standards specified by the Automotive Industry Standards (AIS) and seek professional guidance to assess the quality and compatibility of spare parts with the intended vehicle model. The Lister should support the potential buyers in such diligence.</p><p>Furniture</p><p>Buyers considering the purchase of furniture from our platform are advised to inspect the product's design, dimensions, and materials physically. It is recommended to the buyers to verify the authenticity of wood-based furniture products by ensuring compliance with the Timber and Timber Products (Quality Control) Order, 2020, and seek clarification on the product's durability, maintenance, and warranty terms before finalizing the purchase. The Lister should support the potential buyers in such diligence.</p><p>Fashion</p><p>Prior to purchasing fashion items such as clothing, accessories, or footwear listed on our platform, buyers are advised to review the product's description, size, and material composition. It is recommended to verify the authenticity of branded fashion products by ensuring compliance with the guidelines issued by the Department for Promotion of Industry and Internal Trade (DPIIT) and seek clarification on the product's origin, quality, and return policies before completing the purchase. The Lister should support the potential buyers in such diligence.</p><p>Books, Sports &amp; Hobbies</p><p>Buyers interested in purchasing books, sports equipment, or hobby-related items from our platform should review the product's description, condition, and usability physically. Buyers are also cautioned to ensure the genuineness of the product and adherence to intellectual property rights regulations. Buyers are encouraged to seek clarification on the product's authenticity, edition, and return policies before making a purchase. The Lister should support the potential buyers in such diligence.</p><p>Pets' Food and Accessories</p><p>Prospective listers engaging with listings on our platform should ensure adherence to the guidelines outlined in the FSSAI (Food Safety and Standards Authority of India) and ensure the quality of the feed in lines with the guidelines issued by FSSAI. Additionally, buyers should ensure the health condition of the pets should be considered by potential buyers by themselves prior purchasing the feed from the platform and seek clarification on the pet's feed type, age, vaccination history, and temperament before feeding the respective pet.</p><p>Walkie Talkies</p><p>Listers and buyers of walkie talkies on the PNP platform must ensure strict compliance with applicable Indian laws, including the Indian Wireless Telegraphy Act, 1933 and the Indian Telegraph Act, 1885. All walkie talkie devices must operate within permitted frequency ranges, and Listers must clearly specify the frequency band of the listed device. Only equipment with a valid Equipment Type Approval (ETA) issued by the Wireless Planning and Coordination (WPC) Wing of the Department of Telecommunications (DoT) should be listed. It is the responsibility of the Lister to fully disclose the licensing requirements applicable to the listed device, and buyers are advised to ensure that they hold the necessary licenses prior to purchase and use, wherever required. Unauthorized use, possession, or sale of unapproved wireless equipment may result in legal action including seizure of the device, monetary penalties, and/or criminal prosecution under Indian law. PNP reserves the right to remove any Listing found to be in violation of these legal requirements and may report such violations, including unauthorized use or sale, to the relevant government authorities.</p><p>Miscellaneous Listed Items and Advertisement</p><p>PNP hereby advise the potential buyers and potential lister and advertisers that the miscellaneous listing items which are not including in the list above on the present date should comply with the respective applicable laws and compliances whereas the potential buyers are advised to know and understand the general laws, compliances and diligence about such listed/listing items on the Platform by itself. Potential Buyers may also review the Lister's/service provider's credentials, experience, and customer reviews including statutory licenses that are needed to sell Listed Item and to seek clarification on pricing terms, the service scope, deliverables, and dispute resolution mechanisms before engaging with the service provider.</p><h2>Conduct</h2><p>You undertake that the descriptions, images, and other content pertaining to your goods or services on the platform is accurate and corresponds directly with the appearance, nature, quality, purpose and other general features of such good or service. You further undertake not to post, email, message, host, display, upload, modify, publish, transmit, store, update or share any information on the Platform, or otherwise make available Content:</p><ul><li><p>That violates any law, rule, direction, guideline or regulation, etc;</p></li><li><p>That's copyrighted or patented, protected by trade secret or trademark, or otherwise subject to third-party proprietary rights, including privacy and publicity rights unless you are the owner of such rights or have permission or a license from their rightful owner to post the material and to grant PNP all of the license rights granted herein;</p></li><li><p>That infringes any of the foregoing intellectual property rights of any party, or is Content that you do not have a right to make available under any law, regulation, contractual or fiduciary relationship(s);</p></li><li><p>That is harmful, abusive, unlawful, threatening, harassing, blasphemous, defamatory, obscene, pornographic, paedophilic, libelous, invasive of another's privacy or other rights, including bodily privacy, insulting or harassing on the basis of gender, hateful, or racially, ethnically objectionable, disparaging, relating or encouraging money laundering or gambling or harms or could harm minors in any way promoting enmity between different groups on the grounds of religion or caste with the intent to incite violence or otherwise unlawful in any manner whatsoever or otherwise inconsistent with or contrary to the laws in force;</p></li><li><p>That harasses degrades intimidates, or is hateful towards any individual or group of individuals on the basis of religion, gender, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, age, or disability;</p></li><li><p>That violates any (local) equal employment laws, including but not limited to those prohibiting the stating, in any advertisement for employment, a preference or requirement based on race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, or disability of the applicant.</p></li><li><p>That threatens the unity, integrity, defense, security, or sovereignty of India, friendly relations with foreign states, or public order or causes incitement to the commission of any cognizable offense or prevents investigation of any offense or is insulting any other nation;</p></li><li><p>That includes personal identifiable information about another person without that person's explicit consent;</p></li><li><p>That impersonates any person or entity, including, but not limited to, an PNP employee, or falsely states or otherwise misrepresents an affiliation with a person or entity;</p></li><li><p>Deceives or misleads the addressee about the origin of such messages or communicates any information which is grossly offensive or menacing in nature;</p></li><li><p>That is false, deceptive, misleading, deceitful, misinformative, or constitutes a "bait and switch" offer;</p></li><li><p>That constitutes or contains "pyramid schemes," "affiliate marketing," "link referral code," "junk mail," "spam," "chain letters," or unsolicited advertisements of a commercial nature;</p></li><li><p>That constitutes or contains any form of advertising or solicitation if (1) posted in areas or categories of the Platform which are not designated for such purposes; or (2) e-mailed to PNP users who have requested not to be contacted about other services, products or commercial interests;</p></li><li><p>That includes links to commercial services or Third Party Websites, except as specifically allowed by PNP;</p></li><li><p>That advertises any illegal services or the sale of any items the sale of which is prohibited or restricted by applicable law, including without limitation items the sale of which is prohibited or regulated by applicable law;</p></li><li><p>That contains software viruses or any other computer code, files or programs designed to interrupt, destroy or limit the functionality of any computer software or hardware or telecommunications equipment, or any other computer resource;</p></li><li><p>That disrupts the normal flow of dialogue with an excessive number of messages (flooding attack) to the Service, or that otherwise negatively affects other users' ability to use the Service; or</p></li><li><p>That employs misleading email addresses, forged headers, or otherwise manipulated identifiers in order to disguise the origin of Content transmitted through the Service.</p></li><li><p>That belongs to another person and to which you do not have any right;</p></li><li><p>That is harmful to the child;</p></li><li><p>That deceives or misleads the addressee about the origin of the message or knowingly and intentionally communicates any information which is patently false or misleading in nature but may reasonably be perceived as a fact;</p></li><li><p>Additionally, you undertake not to:</p><ul><li><p>Manipulate the price of the goods or services offered on PNP platform in such a manner as to gain unreasonable profit by imposing on its consumers any unjustified price having regard to the prevailing market conditions, the essential nature of the good or service or any extraordinary circumstances.</p></li><li><p>Discriminate between consumers of the same class or making any arbitrary classification of consumers affecting their rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.</p></li><li><p>Contact anyone who has asked not to be contacted, or makes unsolicited contact with anyone for any commercial purpose, specifically, contact any user to post an advertisement on a third-party website or post any advertisement on behalf of such user; or to "stalk" or otherwise harass anyone;</p></li><li><p>Make any libellous or defamatory comments or postings to or against anyone;</p></li><li><p>Collect personal data about other users or entities for commercial or unlawful purposes;</p></li><li><p>Use automated means, including spiders, robots, crawlers, data mining tools, or the like to download or scrape data from the Service, except for internet search engines (e.g, Google) and non-commercial public archives (e.g. archive.org) that comply with our robots.txt file;</p></li><li><p>Post Content that is outside the local area or not relevant to the local area, repeatedly post the same or similar Content, or otherwise impose unreasonable or disproportionately large loads on our servers and other infrastructure;</p></li><li><p>Post the same item or service in multiple classified categories or forums, or in multiple metropolitan areas;</p></li><li><p>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to computer systems owned or controlled by PNP or engage in any activity that disrupts, diminishes the quality of, interferes with the performance of, or impairs the functionality of, the Service or the Platform.</p></li><li><p>Use any form of automated device or computer program (sometimes referred to as "flagging tools") that enables the use of PNP's "flagging system" or other community control systems without each flag being manually entered by a human that initiates the flag (an "automated flagging device"), or use any such flagging tool to remove posts of competitors, other third parties or to remove posts without a reasonable good faith belief that the post being flagged violates these Terms or any applicable law or regulation.</p></li><li><p>Use any automated device or software that enables the submission of automatic postings on PNP without human intervention or authorship (an "automated posting device"), including without limitation, the use of any such automated posting device in connection with bulk postings, or for automatic submission of postings at certain times or intervals; or</p></li><li><p>Any Content uploaded by you shall be subject to relevant laws and may be disabled, or may be subject to investigation under appropriate laws. Furthermore, if you are found to be in non-compliance with the laws and regulations, these terms, or the privacy policy of the Site, we may terminate your account/block your access to the Site and we reserve the right to remove any non-compliant Content uploaded by you.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2>Paid Services</h2><p>We charge a fee to post content enhanced visibility to the users of the platform ("Paid Services"). The said Paid Services also provide unlimited chat access with the users of the platform of both sides i.e Sellers/Buyers whereas for the users who have not opted the paid services, the chat feature shall have certain restrictions as mentioned in the end of this provision. By opting Paid Services on the Website, you enter into an agreement with PNP, the terms of which are set out herein. Provisions of the Terms relating to the Content shall also be applicable to Paid Services.</p><p>Further, you continue to be bound by the Terms in connection with your use of the Platform and the Services. Currently, for Paid Services, we offer the features described in the following paragraphs. Only some of these features may be made available to you by us, depending on your usage, category, geographical location, and medium of purchase. The terms of Paid Services and the relationship between you and PNP shall be governed by the laws of India.</p><h3>A. Featured Ads</h3><p>Featured Ads is a feature that enables the display of your advertisement in a designated area of the Website and/or in a highlighted manner (depending on the platform the content is being viewed), so as to distinguish it from other content posted on the Website. In the designated area of the Website pertaining to Featured Ads, Features Ads are listed in a sequential manner. Therefore, it is possible that a particular Featured Ad is not visible to you each time you browse through the Website. This feature has been provided to enable users to draw attention to their advertisements and increase the likelihood of receiving responses from potential buyers. We do not guarantee an increase of a specified quantum in the responses received by you and any representation on the Website in this regard is merely indicative. The duration for which your Ad will be displayed as a Featured Ad shall be the number of days specified at the time of purchasing the feature or 30 days from the original date of posting the Content on the Website, whichever is earlier. There is no limit on the volume of Featured Ads you may post on the Website. You can purchase a single Featured ad or can avail bulk packages ("Featured ads package") based on your requirement and such packages may be provided to you at a discounted price as mentioned on the Website. PNP reserves the right to limit the extent and manner in which Featured Ads may be edited by you.</p><h3>B. Minimum Guarantee Package</h3><p>The Minimum Guarantee Package (also referred to as the Minimum Response Package) is an additional feature that enhances visibility of your ad like a Featured Ad limited to the Bikes, Cars, Electronics and Appliances, Furniture, Jobs, Mobile and Properties categories. This package additionally ensures a minimum number of buyer responses in the said categories to you for your Ad during its validity period, as explicitly defined at the time of purchase. If the assured minimum number of responses is not met within the specified duration, PNP shall, at its discretion, provide a refund of the paid value of the package, as per the refund and cancellation policy of PNP mentioned below. This feature may be modified, suspended, or discontinued at any time without prior notice. Users acknowledge that the guarantee pertains only to the number of responses and not to the sale, seriousness of the responses, quality, conversion, or completion of any resulting transaction.</p><h3>C. TopUP</h3><p>TopUP is a feature that bumps your advertisement to the top of the listing space in the city-specific category in which the advertisement has been posted. Your ad will remain in that spot until new advertisements are posted in that category, at which point it will move down accordingly in the listing space. This feature has been provided to enable users to draw attention to their live advertisements and increase the likelihood of receiving responses from potential buyers. We do not guarantee an increase of a specified quantum in the responses received by you and any representation on the Website in this regard is merely indicative. TopUP can be availed for an already posted ad, however, it does not increase the validity of an ad which currently 30 days from the posting date.</p><h3>D. Auto TopUP</h3><p>Auto TopUP is a feature similar to our "TopUP" feature (refer above) that bumps your advertisement to the top of the listing space in the city-specific category in which the advertisement has been posted, just that Auto TopUP does this automatically at defined intervals. PNP shall have the sole discretion to determine the frequency of such intervals for bumping of the advertisement that may differ across categories, usage, and geographical location. This feature has been provided to enable users to draw attention to their live advertisements and increase the likelihood of receiving responses from potential buyers – all on a continuing basis with the convenience of our systems boosting your advertisement on top, during its validity, at a defined periodicity. We do not guarantee an increase of a specified quantum in the responses received by you and any representation on the Website in this regard is merely indicative. Auto TopUP can be availed for an already posted ad, however, it does not increase the validity of an ad which currently is 30 days from the posting date.</p><h3>E. Paid Ads</h3><p>The paid ad is a feature, which enables you to post ads even after you have exhausted your free limits in a category. Free limit defines the number of advertisements that you can post for free in each category within a defined periodicity and this limit may differ across categories, usage, and geographical location. For instance, if you have posted 3 advertisements in a category in the last 30 days and the free limit is 3 advertisements per month for such a category, you will not be allowed to post a free advertisement after you have posted your third advertisement. All advertisements posted by you through your account will be counted towards free limits. Any subsequent change of phone number after posting an ad, will not affect the available limits. You can either purchase a single Paid ad or avail of bulk packages ("Paid ads package") based on your requirement, which shall be provided to you at a discounted price as mentioned on the Website. Please note that the purchase of Paid Ads does not guarantee an increase in the specified quantum of responses received by you, and any representation on the Website in this regard is merely indicative.</p><h3>F. Premium Buyer</h3><p>To enhance visibility and engagement between buyers and Listers, PNP offers optional paid services to interested buyers titled Premium Buyer. This is designed to enhance buyer visibility and enable direct communication with Listers. Buyers subscribing to the Premium Buyer package will receive prominent placement in the list of interested buyers visible to Listers and will be distinguished by a dedicated badge. Additionally, the buyer will gain access to the contact number of the Lister, and upon clicking, the platform will enable redirection to the user's phone dialler for direct communication</p><h3>G. Premium Seller</h3><p>To enhance visibility and engagement between Buyers and Listers, PNP offers optional paid services to interested Listers titled Premium Seller. This is designed to enhance seller visibility and enable direct communication with Buyers. Listers subscribing to the Premium Seller package will get a dedicated badge to distinguish them from other Listers, and their phone number and chat icon will be displayed on their listing for Buyers to connect with them directly, with a prominent placement in the chat box of interested Buyers. Notwithstanding the above, the Buyer's mobile number may not be shared with the Premium Seller when the Buyer is logged in using an email-based account or when the Buyer is on an older version of the PNP application that does not support number sharing. PNP does not guarantee any maximum or minimum number of responses or the sale of any goods/services/products through the Premium Seller service and no refund shall be provided for any reason whatsoever once the Premium Seller service has been purchased.</p><h3>The Validity of Paid Ads/Services</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Limited Paid ads package</strong> – In the Limited Paid ads package, you can post a limited number of ads during the validity of the package. Paid ads in this package shall each be valid for 30 days from the date of posting regardless of when it is posted by you during the life of the Limited Paid ads package.</p></li><li><p><strong>Unlimited Paid ads package</strong> – In the Unlimited Paid ads package, you can post unlimited ads during the validity of the package. Regardless of when you post an advertisement during the life of the package, the advertisement will only remain valid during the validity of the package.</p></li></ul><h3>Payment for Paid Services</h3><p>Upon selecting any feature of Paid Services, you may be redirected to a third-party payment processing site such as Razorpay offering payment through various channels such as net banking, debit card and credit card ("Payment Gateway"). PNP may offer you a right to pay through cash or other channels such as cash collection. You agree that Paid Services will be made available to you only upon receipt of payment confirmation from the Payment Gateway or collection agencies. Upon making payment to us, through any medium whatsoever, you warrant to us that you are entitled to use the medium or otherwise make the payment to us under applicable law. You have the ability to provide us your Goods and Services Tax Identification Number (GSTIN) on the platform. Your GSTIN details are mandatory for passing on the credit of GST charged. In case you fail to provide us with your GSTIN details, we will assume that you are not registered with the GST authorities, without independently verifying your registration status. Unless otherwise mentioned on the Website, prices indicated are inclusive of applicable taxes.</p><h3>Refunds/Cancellation</h3><p>If you fail to avail choose to delete or deactivate any Paid Services, we will not be liable to refund you for any unutilized time, However for the Minimum Guarantee Package the refund shall be permissible at the discretion PNP, subject to the conditions precedent to the same. In the event you are not able to avail of the Paid Services on the Website on account of any technical reasons, on receipt of payment confirmation, equivalent units of the paid feature against the ad units you were not able to post shall be credited to your account against the respective paid service, if applicable. For example, if you buy a package of 3 Featured Ad units out of which you have consumed only 2 units and were unable to post the remaining 1 ad unit as a Featured Ad on account of a technical glitch during the lifetime of the package validity, you will be credited only 1 unit of Featured Ad to your account. The above refund policy shall not be applicable in the event any content in your advertisement is found to be violating the Terms or there has been any abuse reported in relation to your advertisement or your advertisement is deleted or not re-posted on the Website on account of any technical reasons due to any subsequent editing done by you.</p><p>There would be no commission fee for any buying or selling of your product/services. We offer initial 15 days free posting, listing, finding and interacting with your potential customer. We only charge renewal fee once in 15 days from the date of your listing and finding potential customer.</p><h2>Device Login Configuration</h2><p>To enhance account security and promote the responsible use of PNP's services, a device login limitation procedure has been implemented for all sellers/Listers and buyers accounts (User). This procedure defines access limits, enforcement and usage rights. For Users who have not availed any Paid Services, account access is restricted to a single device OTP verification of each individual device. Any attempt to bypass these restrictions, such as through device spoofing, unauthorized sharing, or account manipulation, will be considered as a breach of the PNP Terms of Use. Such violations may lead to immediate suspension or termination of the account, at PNP's discretion, without prior notice. PNP also reserves the right to recover any losses, claims, damages, penalties etc., arising from such violations and may monitor user activity as needed to enforce this.</p><p>PNP reserves the right to modify or update this login limitation procedure at its sole discretion. Any change in the procedure will be mandatorily binding on all Users.</p><h2>Posting Agents</h2><p>As used herein, the term "Posting Agent" refers to a third-party agent, service, or intermediary that post Content to the Service on behalf of others. PNP prohibits the use of Posting Agents, except with express written permission or license from the original owner of the listed Items, failing which Lister (Posting Agent) shall solely be liable for any breach, infringement, claims, penalties, damages, etc., claimed by the original owner/right holder of such Listed Item, PNP shall not held liable and shall not be party to such breach in any form and manner.</p><h2>Access to the Service</h2><p>PNP grants you a limited, revocable, non-exclusive license to access and use the Service for personal use. This license granted herein does not include any of the following: (a) subject to conditions mentioned herein above, access to or use of the Service by Posting Agents; or (b) any collection, aggregation, copying, duplication, display, or derivative use of the Service nor any use of data mining, robots, spiders, or similar data gathering and extraction tools for any purpose unless expressly permitted by PNP or as otherwise set forth in these Terms. Notwithstanding the foregoing, general purpose internet search engines and non-commercial public archives that gather information for the sole purpose of displaying hyperlinks to the Service, provided they each do so from a stable IP address or range of IP addresses using an easily identifiable agent and comply with our robots.txt file, may engage in the activities set forth in (b). For purposes of this exception, a "general purpose internet search engine" does not include a website or search engine or other services that specializes in classified listings including any subset of classifieds listings such as housing, for sale, jobs, services, or personals, or which otherwise provides classified ad listing services. The license set forth in this Section permits you to display on your website, or create a hyperlink thereto, individual postings on the Service so long as such use is for non-commercial and/or news reporting purposes only (e.g., for use in personal blogs or other personal online media). If the total number of such postings displayed on or linked to your website exceeds limits set by PNP, your use will be considered to be in violation of these Terms, unless PNP expressly grants you permission otherwise. You are also permitted to create a hyperlink to the home page of the Platform so long as the link does not portray PNP, its employees, affiliates, or agents in a false, confusing, misleading, derogatory, or otherwise offensive matter. Use of the Service beyond the scope of authorized access as set forth in these Terms immediately terminates any permission or license granted herein. In order to collect, aggregate, copy, duplicate, display or make derivative use of the Service or any Content made available via the Service for other purposes (including commercial purposes) not stated herein, you must first obtain a license from PNP.</p><h2>Notification of Claims of Infringements</h2><p>PNP is not liable for any infringement of intellectual property rights arising out of materials posted on or transmitted through the site, or items advertised on the site, by end-users, or any other third parties.</p><p>If you are an owner of intellectual property rights or an agent who is fully authorized to act on behalf of the owner of intellectual property rights and believe that any Content or other content infringes upon your intellectual property right or intellectual property right of the owner on whose behalf you are authorized to act, you may submit a notification to PNP together with a request to PNP to delete the relevant Content in good faith in the claims of infringement.</p><p>In case you are an owner of an Intellectual Property and want to specifically report about any counterfeit goods on our Platform please refer to our PNP Counterfeit Policy.</p><h2>Intellectual Property Right</h2><p>You acknowledge and agree that the materials on the Platform, other than the User Content that you licensed under Section II(C) of the Terms, including without limitation, the text, software, scripts, graphics, photos, sounds, music, videos, interactive features and the like ("Materials") and the trademarks, service marks and logos contained therein ("Marks"), are licensed to PNP, and are subject to copyright and other intellectual property rights under Indian law. In connection with the Services, the Platform may display certain trademarks belonging to third parties. Use of these trademarks may be subject to the license granted by third parties to PNP.</p><p>You shall, in no event, reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble such trademarks and nothing herein shall be construed to grant you any right in relation to such trademarks. Materials on the Platform are provided to you on an 'AS IS' basis for your information and personal use only and may not be used, copied, reproduced, distributed, transmitted, broadcast, displayed, sold, licensed, or otherwise exploited for any other purposes whatsoever without the prior written consent of the respective owners or licensees, as applicable. PNP reserves all rights not expressly granted herein to the Platform and the Materials. You agree to not engage in the use, copying, or distribution of any of the Materials other than as expressly permitted herein, including any use, copying, or distribution of Materials of third parties obtained through the Platform for any commercial purposes. If you download or print a copy of the Materials for personal use, you must retain all copyright and other proprietary notices contained therein. You agree not to circumvent, disable or otherwise interfere with security-related features of the Platform or features that prevent or restrict the use or copying of any Materials or enforce limitations on the use of the Platform or the Materials therein. The Service is protected to the maximum extent permitted by copyright laws and, other laws currently in force in India. The content displayed on or through the Service is protected by copyright as a collective work and/or compilation, pursuant to copyright laws and, other laws currently in force in India. Any reproduction, modification, creation of derivative works from or redistribution of the Platform, the Materials, or the collective work or compilation is expressly prohibited. Copying or reproducing the Platform, the Materials, or any portion thereof to any other server or location for further reproduction or redistribution is expressly prohibited. You further agree not to reproduce, duplicate, or copy Content or Materials from the Service, and agree to abide by any and all copyright notices and other notices displayed on the Service.</p><p>You may not decompile or disassemble, reverse engineer or otherwise attempt to discover any source code contained in the Service. Without limiting the foregoing, you agree not to reproduce, duplicate, copy, sell, resell or exploit for any commercial purposes, any aspect of the Service.</p><h2>User Submissions</h2><p>You understand that when using the Platform, you will be exposed to Content from a variety of sources and that PNP is not responsible for the accuracy, usefulness, safety, or intellectual property rights of or relating to such Content, and you agree and assume all liability for your use. You further understand and acknowledge that you may be exposed to Content that is inaccurate, offensive, indecent, or objectionable, defamatory, or libelous and you agree to waive, and hereby do waive, any legal or equitable rights or remedies you have or may have against PNP with respect thereto.</p><h2